 "the_gap": "The system has no way to say `I cannot assess this`. Both states that mean that are emitted as health. That is the finding, and it is a semantics gap rather than an observability limit.",
 "two_numbers_not_one": "T_FH_deployed folds in the failsafe level, which the freshness disjunct drives out of NORMAL about 1.5 s after onset without the diagnosis contributing anything. T_FH_attribution_only excludes the failsafe and measures the channel this paper's claim is about: naming the cause. Reporting only the first would understate the attribution failure by more than an order of magnitude; reporting only the second would overstate the vehicle's exposure, because the escalation path does hold."
